{"id":"91ccfde35d1e5b37","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-thm-hierarchy-facts.md","title":"Cumulative Hierarchy Facts","display":"thm-hierarchy-facts — Cumulative Hierarchy Facts","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-hierarchy-facts","aliases":["58-thm-hierarchy-facts"],"display":"thm-hierarchy-facts — Cumulative Hierarchy Facts","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-hierarchy-facts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-hierarchy-facts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hierarchy-facts — Cumulative Hierarchy Facts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aabdf3005231e9dc\" href=\"?note=aabdf3005231e9dc\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md\">../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c14ba496c480dcd6\" href=\"?note=c14ba496c480dcd6\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-transitive-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in V\">\\(x\\in V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}facts}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\bigr)\n\\land V_\\alpha\\in V_{\\alpha+1}\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V_\\alpha)\n\\land\\bigl(x\\in V_\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}facts}\\vdash\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\bigr)\n\\to\\Bigl[\n\\bigl(V_\\alpha\\subseteq V_\\beta\\leftrightarrow\\alpha\\leq\\beta\\bigr)\n\\land V_\\alpha\\in V_{\\alpha+1}\n\\land\\mathrm{TransitiveSet}_S(V_\\alpha)\n\\land\\bigl(x\\in V_\\alpha\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{rank}(x)&lt;\\alpha\\bigr)\n\\Bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The hierarchy is strictly increasing in its ordinal index and each stage is transitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md","status":"resolved","id":"aabdf3005231e9dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-v-alpha.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":